[Term]
id: DOID:8689
name: anorexia nervosa
def: "An eating disorder characterized by refusal to maintain a healthy body weight, and an obsessive fear of gaining weight due to a distorted self image." []
def: "An eating disorder that is characterized by the lack or loss of appetite, known as anorexia. Other features include excess fear of becoming overweight; body image disturbance; significant weight loss; refusal to maintain minimal normal weight; and amenorrhea." []
comment: Although anorexia nervosa is often simply referred to as "anorexia", "anorexia" refers to anorexia behavior and not the disorder itself.
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anorexia_nervosa
