[Term]
id: GAZ:00000458
name: North America
def: "North America is a continent in the western hemisphere of Earth, bordered to the west by the Pacific Ocean, the east by the Atlantic Ocean, the north by the Arctic Ocean, and connected at the south to South America by the Isthmus of Panama." []
def: "The northern continent of the Western Hemisphere, extending northward from the Colombia-Panama border and including Central America, Mexico, Caribbean area, the United States, Canada and Greenland. The term often refers more narrowly to Mexico, continental United States, and Canada." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:North_America
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_America
