[Term]
id: GAZ:00000555
name: North Africa
def: "The geographical area of Africa comprising Algeria; Egypt; Libya; Morocco and Tunisia. It includes also the vast deserts and oases of the Sahara. It is often referred to as North Africa or the Maghreb." []
def: "The northernmost region of the African continent, separated by the Sahara from Sub-Saharan Africa." []
