[Term]
id: GAZ:00000562
name: Tunisia
def: "A country situated on the Mediterranean coast of North Africa. It is bordered by Algeria to the west and Libya to the southeast. Tunisia is subdivided into 24 governorates, divided into 262 \"delegations\" or \"districts\" (mutamadiyat), and further subdivided into municipalities (shaykhats)." []
