[Term]
id: GAZ:00000565
name: Morocco
def: "A country in North Africa. It has a coast on the Atlantic Ocean that reaches past the Strait of Gibraltar into the Mediterranean Sea. Morocco has international borders with Algeria to the east, Spain to the north (a water border through the Strait and land borders with two small Spanish autonomous cities, Ceuta and Melilla), and Mauritania to the south. Morocco is divided into 16 regions, and subdivided into 62 prefectures and provinces. Because of the conflict over Western Sahara, the status of both regions of \"Saguia el-Hamra\" and \"Rio de Oro\" is disputed." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Morocco
