[Term]
id: GAZ:00000567
name: Ethiopia
def: "A country in eastern Africa, between Somalia and Sudan." []
def: "An independent state in eastern Africa. Ethiopia is located in the Horn of Africa and is bordered on the north and northeast by Eritrea, on the east by Djibouti and Somalia, on the south by Kenya, and on the west and southwest by Sudan. Its capital is Addis Ababa." []
