[Term]
id: GAZ:00000584
name: Mali
def: "A country in western Africa, east of Mauritania and south of Algeria. Its capital is Bamako. From 1904-1920 it was known as Upper Senegal-Niger; prior to 1958, as French Sudan; 1958-1960 as the Sudanese Republic and 1959-1960 it joined Senegal in the Mali Federation. It became an independent republic in 1960." []
def: "A country in western Africa, southwest of Algeria and east of Mauritania." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mali
