[Term]
id: GAZ:00002463
name: Central Asia
def: "The geographical area of Asia comprising Kazakhstan; Kyrgyzstan; Tajikistan; Turkmenistan; and Uzbekistan. The desert region of Kara Kum (Qara Qum) is largely in Turkmenistan and the desert region of Kyzyl Kum (Kizil Kum or Qizil Qum), is in Uzbekistan and Kazakhstan." []
