[Term]
id: GAZ:00002464
name: Southwest Asia
def: "The westernmost subregion of Asia." []
comment: Note that this term is in limited use, as it significantly overlaps with the Middle East (or the Near East), the main difference usually being the exclusion of the majority of Egypt, which would be counted as part of North Africa (that is, Egypt without the Sinai Peninsula), and of European Turkey and the inclusion of the Caucasus.
is_a: GAZ:00000465 ! Asia
