[Term]
id: GAZ:00002471
name: East Asia
def: "The eastern subregion of Asia, defined in both geographical and ethno-cultural terms. The region includes China, Hong Kong, Macau, Japan, Mongolia, North Korea, South Korea and Taiwan. People Indigenous to the region are known as East Asians. China, Japan, Korea, and Vietnam belong to the East Asian cultural sphere." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Asia
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q27231
