[Term]
id: GAZ:00002944
name: Portugal
def: "A country in southwestern Europe on the Iberian Peninsula and including the Atlantic archipelagos of the Azores and Madeira are also part of Portugal. Portugal is divided into 308 municipalities (Portuguese singular/plural: concelho/concelhos), which are subdivided into more than 4,000 parishes (freguesia/freguesias). Municipalities are grouped for administrative purposes into superior units. For continental Portugal the municipalities are gathered in 18 Districts, while the Islands have a Regional Government directly above them." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Portugal
