[Term]
id: GAZ:00003940
name: Metropolitan France
def: "A part of the country of France that extends from the Mediterranean Sea to the English Channel and the North Sea, and from the Rhine to the Atlantic Ocean. Metropolitan France is bordered by Belgium, Luxembourg, Germany, Switzerland, Italy, Monaco, Andorra, and Spain." []
is_a: GAZ:00002940 ! France
property_value: dc:identifier "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GAZ_00003940" xsd:anyURI

[Term]
id: GAZ:00003948
name: Lesser Antilles
def: "Part of a long volcanic island arc, most of which wraps around the eastern end of the Caribbean Sea on the western boundary with the Atlantic Ocean, and some of which lies on the southern fringe of the sea just north of South America. The Lesser Antilles more or less coincide with the outer edge of the Caribbean Plate, and many of the islands were formed by subduction, as one or more other plates slipped under the Caribbean Plate." []
