[Term]
id: GAZ:00004108
name: Arrondissement of Brussels
def: "The only administrative arrondissement in the Brussels-Capital Region in Belgium. Because it is the only administrative arrondissement in the Brussels Region, its territory coincides with that of the latter. The Brussels-Capital Region is divided into 19 municipalities." []
is_a: GAZ:00003558 ! Brussels-Capital Region

