name: Northern California
def: "The northern portion of the State of California. The region contains the San Francisco Bay Area, the state capital, Sacramento; as well as the redwood forests, the northern California coast, the Big Sur coastline area, the Sierra Nevada including Yosemite Valley and Lake Tahoe, Mt. Shasta which is the second-highest peak in the Cascade Range, and the Central Valley." []
