[Term]
id: GAZ:00006330
name: Barnstable County
def: "A county located in the Commonwealth of Massachusetts, consisting of Cape Cod and associated islands. The county seat is Barnstable. Barnstable County borders Plymouth County to the northwest; off Barnstable County's southern shore are Dukes County and Nantucket." []
