[Term]
id: GSSO:000084
name: species dysphoria
def: "Dysphoria associated with the feeling that one's body is of the wrong species." []
comment: "Species dysphoria" is not a medical diagnosis and is not recognized by DSM-5. It is merely a descriptive label used by otherkin and therians. Often transphobic sources may compare species dysphoria to gender dysphoria, although these two concepts are ostensibly unrelated.
