[Term]
id: GSSO:000103
name: biological sex
name: biologisk køn {xref="https://lgbt.dk/ordbog/biologisk-koen/"}
name: sexe biologique {terms:isReferencedBy="GSSO:011927"}
def: "Biological sex is the quality of a biological organism based on reproductive function or organs." []
comment: In general, the term "biological sex" should be avoided, especially in medical contexts. Instead, more specific terms such as "chromosomal sex" should be utilized.
synonym: "sex as a biological variable" RELATED [] {comment="Although the term \"sex as a biological variable\" (SABV) was likely introduced with little to no involvement from transphobic hate groups, it has been appropriated as a signaling term in the same manner as \"biological sex\". Regardless of this, SABV suffers from the same lack of conceptual framework as \"biological sex\", i.e. lack of consideration of reproducible criteria for defining the term.", Property:P1813="SABV"}
