[Term]
id: GSSO:000130
name: transgender person
def: "A person whose gender identity does not match their gender assigned at birth or a person who otherwise identifies as transgender." []
def: "An individual who identifies as transgender." []
comment: Note that, because "transgender" is an adjective, "trans person" is preferable to "transperson".
comment: The adjective "transgender" should never have an extraneous "-ed" attached to it. This is confusing and grammatically unnecessary.
