property_value: Property:P1683 "I am trying to assess campus climates for the transgender community, both at my own institution and at other campuses. Any information regarding this subject would be tremendously helpful to this effort. Personal testimony, activism, organizations, experience of providers and human service workers, etc. Issues of interest are transphobia, hostility, general knowledge and understanding, attitudes of the queer community and cisgendered people, etc. I am interested in building coalitions and will share any info with others." xsd:string {terms:source="https://web.archive.org/web/20181014051630/https://groups.google.com/forum/message/raw?msg=alt.transgendered/acBONWZqmhs/xo2v8gve62kJ"}
