[Term]
id: GSSO:000398
name: gay person
def: "A person who is attracted solely or primarily to others of the same gender (or sex, depending on precise usage), i.e. being either a male androphile or a female gynephile." []
comment: Note that transgender women who are attracted to women can be described as gay women (or lesbians; sometimes the term "transbian" is used). Equivalently, transgender men who are attracted to men can be described as gay men.
