[Term]
id: GSSO:000498
name: mental disorder
def: "A behavioral or mental pattern that causes significant distress or impairment of personal functioning. Such features may be persistent, relapsing and remitting, or occur as a single event. Many disorders have been described, with signs and symptoms that vary widely between specific disorders." []
