[Term]
id: GSSO:000509
name: preadolescence
def: "A stage of human development following early childhood and preceding adolescence. It commonly ends with the beginning of puberty, but may also be defined as ending with the start of the teenage years. For example, the age range is commonly designated as 10–13 years." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Preadolescence
