[Term]
id: GSSO:000541
name: neurosyphilis
def: "Infection of the brain or spinal cord by Treponema pallidum. It occurs many years following the original infection which remained untreated. Signs and symptoms include abnormal gait, blindness, depression, paralysis, seizures and dementia." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neurosyphilis
