[Term]
id: GSSO:000542
name: paralytic dementia
def: "A severe neuropsychiatric disorder, classified as an organic mental disorder and caused by the chronic meningoencephalitis that leads to cerebral atrophy in late-stage syphilis. Degenerative changes are associated primarily with the frontal and temporal lobar cortex. The disease affects approximately 7% of infected individuals." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_paresis_of_the_insane
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1932655
