[Term]
id: GSSO:001032
name: Arab
def: "An ethnic group inhabiting the Arab world. They primarily live in the Arab states in Western Asia, North Africa, the Horn of Africa and western Indian Ocean islands. They also form a significant diaspora, with Arab communities established around the world." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arabs
