[Term]
id: GSSO:001221
name: aesthetic attraction
name: æstetisk tiltrækning {xref="https://lgbt.dk/ordbog/aestetisk-tiltraekning/"}
def: "Attraction in which someone appreciates the appearance, beauty, or aesthetics of another person or persons, disconnected from sexual or romantic attraction." []
comment: This type of attraction has been likened to aesthetic pleasures or desires, such as listening to a good song, enjoying a beautiful sunset, or admiring a piece of artwork.
