[Term]
id: GSSO:001232
name: atracción hacia el mismo sexo {terms:isReferencedBy="https://web.archive.org/web/20200102232435/lgbthealtheducation.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/National-LGBT-Health-Education-Center-Glossary.SPANISH-2018.pdf"}
name: same-sex attraction
def: "Interpersonal attractions between members of the same gender (or sex, depending on the organism in question)." []
comment: Note that same-sex and same-gender attraction are listed as synonyms in this entry. This may not always be the case depending on the type of organism (i.e. human or non-human) or when considering sex vs. gender in various arenas. In general, attraction is based on a number of factors in humans, including gender expression (but not unknowable biological factors such as chromosomal composition or individual gene expression).
comment: Note that when specifically discussing sexual attraction, "same-sex sexual attraction" or "same-gender sexual attraction" may be a better term (as opposed to other forms of attraction).
synonym: "same-sex attracted" RELATED []
is_a: GSSO:001218 ! interpersonal attraction
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "same-gender attraction" xsd:string {RELATED="same-gender attracted", Property:P1813="SGA"}
property_value: Property:P1813 "SSA" xsd:string
property_value: schema:alternateName "same-sex attractions" xsd:string
property_value: terms:isReferencedBy https://web.archive.org/web/20190728210238/https://www.pinknews.co.uk/2017/11/27/the-ultimate-lgbt-glossary-all-your-questions-answered/

