[Term]
id: GSSO:001259
name: fetishistic disorder
def: "A fetishistic disorder is an extreme sexual attraction to non-human objects or body parts which are not traditionally considered sexual which occurs alongside distress or impairment deemed clinically significant." []
comment: Because the word "fetish" is used in so many contexts, it can be difficult to determine what constitutes a fetishistic disorder. For example, fetishization of feminine breasts is relatively common and would only be considered a fetishistic disorder under extreme circumstances.
synonym: "psychiatric fetishism" RELATED []
