[Term]
id: GSSO:001496
name: North German Confederation
def: "The German federal state which existed from July 1867 to December 1870. Although de jure a confederacy of equal states, the Confederation was de facto controlled and led by the largest and most powerful member, Prussia, which exercised its influence to bring about the formation of the German Empire." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_German_Confederation
