name: testicular feminization
def: "Feminization of the testicles based on the inaction of androgens, and subsequent aromatization of testosterone into estrogen." []
comment: Note that, due to later work by Lawson Wilkins, a general shift in nomenclature occurred, resulting in "testicular feminization" because more often referred to as "androgen resistance".
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Androgen_insensitivity_syndrome#Testicular_feminization
is_a: GSSO:001580 ! feminization
