[Term]
id: GSSO:001590
name: biseksuel {xref="https://lgbt.dk/ordbog/biseksuel/"}
name: biseksüel {terms:isReferencedBy="https://web.archive.org/web/20190123175918/https://oramrefugee.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/Glossary-PDF.pdf"}
name: bisexual
name: bisexual {terms:isReferencedBy="https://web.archive.org/web/20200102232435/lgbthealtheducation.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/National-LGBT-Health-Education-Center-Glossary.SPANISH-2018.pdf"}
def: "Historically, bisexual referred to attraction to persons of two gender identities, typically, but not always, defined as male and female. In modern use, it is usually used to refer to persons who are sexually and/or romantically attracted to persons with a gender or genders like theirs and those with a gender or genders unlike theirs." []
comment: Note that sometimes bisexual may be used as a synonym of pansexual.
