id: GSSO:001648
name: orchiectomi {xref="https://lgbt.dk/ordbog/orchidektomiorchiectomi/"}
name: orchiectomy
def: "A surgical procedure in which one or both testicles are removed (bilateral orchiectomy). The surgery is typically performed as treatment for testicular cancer, in some cases of testicular torsion, and is sometimes used in the management of advanced prostate cancer. It may also be performed as part of transfeminine gender confirmation surgery." []
