[Term]
id: GSSO:001695
name: castration
def: "Surgical removal or artificial destruction of gonads." []
comment: Note that the connotation of "castration" is negative and may not always represent the state of the individual person post-castration. Use less stigmatizing words when current status is unknown, especially if "castration" is medical in nature.
comment: Use "emasculation" for removal of a cisgender man's testicles and penis. Use "orchiectomy" or "penectomy" for transgender women.
xref: https://lgbt.wikia.org/wiki/Castration
is_a: GSSO:001694 ! genital mutilation
