[Term]
id: GSSO:001899
name: sexual maturation disorder
def: "Sexual maturation disorder is a disorder of anxiety or depression related to an uncertainty about one's gender identity and/or sexual orientation." []
comment: Note that neither sexual orientation or gender identity are considered in and of themselves disorders; in this sense, sexual maturation disorder could be considered culturally bound within societies which mistreat sexual and gender minorities. Further, sexual maturation disorder is, by definition, different from ego-dystonic sexual orientation wherein sexual orientation or gender identity is repressed or otherwise denied.
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sexual_maturation_disorder
