[Term]
id: GSSO:002188
name: bacha bāzī
def: "A slang term in Afghanistan for a wide variety of activities involving sexual relations between older men and younger adolescent men, or boys. The practitioner is commonly called bacha baz (meaning \"boy play\" in Dari) or simply bach. It may include to some extent sexual slavery and child prostitution. Bacha bāzī is currently reported in various parts of Afghanistan. Force and coercion are common, and security officials state they are unable to end such practices because many of the men involved in bacha bazi-related activities are powerful and well-armed warlords." []
synonym: "Bacha bazi" EXACT []
synonym: "bacha bazi" EXACT []
