[Term]
id: GSSO:002269
name: territorial nationalism
def: "A form of nationalism based on the belief that all inhabitants of a particular territory should share a common national identity, regardless of their ethnic, linguistic, religious, cultural and other differences." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Territorial_nationalism
is_a: GSSO:002260 ! nationalism

[Term]
id: GSSO:002270
name: regional nationalism
def: "a form of nationalism based on the belief that all inhabitants of a particular distinctive sub-sovereign region should share a common national identity, regardless of their ethnic, linguistic, religious, cultural and other differences." []
is_a: GSSO:002269 ! territorial nationalism

