name: kønsvarians {xref="https://lgbt.dk/ordbog/koensvarians/"}
def: "Gender variance, or, sometimes, gender nonconformity, is behavior or gender expression exhibited by an individual that does not match cultural/social masculine and feminine gender norms and/or expectations." []
comment: "Gender non-conforming" and "gender diverse" are often preferred to "gender variant" because "gender variant" (and, by extension, "gender variance") implies a standard normative for gender (i.e. a way gender is "supposed to be"). However, many resources emply the term as a helpful "catch-all" for various transgender and cultural gender roles and identities.
