name: kathoey
def: "A gender role or category in Thailand, which often overlaps significantly with being a transgender woman or a feminine gay man." []
comment: Note that very few transgender women in Thailand refer to themselves as "kathoey". Instead, the term "phuying" (Thai: 'woman') or "phuying praphet song" (Thai: 'a second kind of woman').
