name: Xジェンダー
def: "Transgender identity in Japan which is not considered male or female. Sometimes considered equivalent to words like genderqueer or non-binary." []
comment: Individuals who are X-gender may refer to themselves as FTX (female to X-gender) or MTX (male to X-gender) instead of FTM or MTF.
