[Term]
id: GSSO:002410
name: demonstrative
def: "A word used to indicate which entities are being referred to and to distinguish those entities from others. They are typically deictic; their meaning depending on a particular frame of reference and cannot be understood without context." []
synonym: "demonstrative pronoun" RELATED [] {schema:alternateName="demonstrative pronouns"}
