[Term]
id: GSSO:002810
name: scientific racism
def: "Pseudoscientific belief that empirical evidence exists to support or justify racism (racial discrimination), racial inferiority, or racial superiority. Historically, scientific racism received credence throughout the scientific community, but it is no longer considered scientific." []
comment: Note that modern scientific racist ideas and proponents have attempted to rebrand their ideas as "race realism" and "human biodiversity".
synonym: "GSSO:011007" RELATED []
synonym: "race biology" RELATED []
synonym: "race realism" RELATED []
synonym: "racial realism" RELATED []
