[Term]
id: GSSO:002848
name: internalized heterosexism
def: "The internalization of assumptions, negative attitudes and stigma regarding homosexuality by individuals whom do not identify within the heteronormative spectrum and/or are categorized as sexual minorities to varying degrees." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internalized_sexism#Internalized_heterosexism
