[Term]
id: GSSO:002849
name: internalized sexism
def: "Sexism that occurs on an individual level. Internalized sexism is when an individual enacts learned sexist behaviors and attitudes towards themselves and people of their own sex." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internalized_sexism
is_a: GSSO:002797 ! sexism
property_value: Property:P5191 GSSO:002797

