[Term]
id: GSSO:002855
name: thyroid cartilage masculinization
def: "A surgical procedure in which the thyroid cartilage is enlarged and masculinized to enhance the laryngeal prominence (the Adam's Apple)." []
is_a: GSSO:002827 ! thyroid cartilage surgical procedure
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "masculinization of the thyroid cartilage" xsd:string

[Term]
id: GSSO:002856
name: thyroid cartilage feminization
def: "A surgical procedure in which the thyroid cartilage is feminized, typically by reducing the size of the laryngeal prominence (the Adam's Apple)." []
is_a: GSSO:002827 ! thyroid cartilage surgical procedure
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "feminization of the thyroid cartilage" xsd:string

[Term]
id: GSSO:002857
name: thyroid cartilage reduction
def: "A surgical procedure in which the thyroid cartilage is reduced in size by shaving down the cartilage through an incision in the throat, generally to aid those who are uncomfortable with the girth of their laryngeal prominence (Adam's apple)." []
is_a: GSSO:002827 ! thyroid cartilage surgical procedure
