[Term]
id: GSSO:002864
name: lesbophobia
def: "Various forms of negativity towards lesbians as individuals, as couples, or as a social group. Based on the categories of sex, sexual orientation, identity, and gender expression, this negativity encompasses prejudice, discrimination, hatred, and abuse; with attitudes and feelings ranging from disdain to hostility. Lesbophobia is misogyny that intersects with homophobia, and vice versa." []
synonym: "dykephobia" NARROW [] {RELATED="dykephobic"}
synonym: "lesbomismia" RELATED []
synonym: "lesbophobic" RELATED []
