[Term]
id: GSSO:002867
name: internalized transphobia
def: "Transphobia against oneself supposedly caused by one's own repressed transgender identity." []
synonym: "internalized trans-phobia" EXACT []
is_a: GSSO:002862 ! كراهية مصححي الهوية الجنسانية
property_value: Property:P5191 GSSO:002862

[Term]
id: GSSO:002868
name: neopagan transphobia
def: "Transphobia within neopagan communities, related closely to radical feminist transphobia. It is eespecially common in Dianic Wiccan circles, and transgender women have been excluded from events at nominally ecumenical neopagan gatherings." []
is_a: GSSO:002862 ! كراهية مصححي الهوية الجنسانية
property_value: Property:P5191 GSSO:002862

[Term]
id: GSSO:002869
name: selective transphobia
def: "Transphobia which makes exceptions for transgender people deemed \"trans enough\" or who have had mostly successful outward transitions in terms of \"expected\" gender presentation. It makes a distinction between \"true\" transgender people and \"transtrenders\", persons who are supposedly only pretending to be trans as a modern fad." []
is_a: GSSO:002862 ! كراهية مصححي الهوية الجنسانية
property_value: Property:P5191 GSSO:002862

