[Term]
id: GSSO:003011
name: ethnic violence
def: "A form of political violence expressly motivated by ethnic hatred and ethnic conflict." []
def: "Violence or other hostile behavior arising when an ethnic group either feels itself under threat, or where it seeks to assert its superiority or dominance over other groups." []
synonym: "GSSO:000933" RELATED []
