[Term]
id: GSSO:003018
name: LGBTQ violence
def: "Violence against lesbian, gay, bisexual, and trangender people (as well as other sexual and gender minorities) motivated by hateful attitudes towards their existence. Such violence can take many forms such as intimidation, assault, or lynching." []
