[Term]
id: GSSO:003033
name: school violence
def: "Violence encompassing physical violence, including student-on-student fighting and corporal punishment; psychological violence, including verbal abuse; sexual violence, including rape and sexual harassment; many forms of bullying, including cyberbullying; and carrying weapons in school. It is widely held to have become a serious problem in recent decades in many countries, especially where weapons such as guns or knives are involved. It includes violence between school students as well as physical attacks by students on school staff." []
synonym: "violence in schools" RELATED []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/School_violence
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1145436
is_a: GSSO:003031 ! violence by location
