[Term]
id: GSSO:003034
name: campus violence
def: "Violence encompassing physical violence, including student-on-student fighting and corporal punishment; psychological violence, including verbal abuse; sexual violence, including rape and sexual harassment; many forms of bullying, including cyberbullying; and carrying weapons in institutions of higher learning such as colleges and universities. It is widely held to have become a serious problem in recent decades in many countries, especially where weapons such as guns or knives are involved. It includes violence between school students as well as physical attacks by students on school staff." []
synonym: "college campus violence" RELATED []
is_a: GSSO:003033 ! school violence
