[Term]
id: GSSO:003057
name: anti-LGBTQ rape
def: "A hate crime in which one or more people are raped because of their perceived sexual orientation, gender identity, and/or gender expression. The common intended consequence of the rape, as seen by the perpetrator, is to turn the person heterosexual or to enforce conformity with gender stereotypes." []
