[Term]
id: GSSO:003188
name: bathroom bill
def: "The common name for proposed legislation that defines access to public toilets by gender (restrooms)—or for transgender individuals. Bathroom bills affect access to sex-segregated public facilities for an individual based on a determination of their sex as defined in some specific way—such as their sex as assigned at birth, their sex as listed on their birth certificate, or the sex that corresponds to their gender identity." []
synonym: "public bathroom bill" RELATED [] {schema:alternateName="public bathroom bills"}
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bathroom_bill
