[Term]
id: GSSO:003280
name: mixoscopy
def: "The attainment of sexual pleasure from watching other people have sex." []
comment: Often used interchangeably with voyeurism or scopophilia. However, sometimes differentiated by saying that mixoscopy refers to watching others with their knowledge, while voyeurism refers to watching others secretly.
synonym: "mixophilia" RELATED []
synonym: "mixoscopia" RELATED []
synonym: "mixoscopic" RELATED []
