[Term]
id: GSSO:003283
name: personal identity
def: "The unique numerical identity of a person or being in the course of time." []
comment: Numerical identity here refers to the philosophical concept in which an identity has absolute or total qualitative identity, as opposed to quantitative identity.
synonym: "identify as" RELATED [] {hasSynonym="identifies as"}
