[Term]
id: GSSO:003286
name: seksuel identitet {xref="https://lgbt.dk/ordbog/seksuel-identitet/"}
name: sexual identity
def: "Sexual identity is how one thinks of oneself in terms of to whom one is sexually attracted. Note that sexual identity may also refer to sexual orientation identity, which is when people identify or dis-identify with a sexual orientation or choose not to identify with a sexual orientation." []
comment: Note that some early usage of this term (pre-1990s) conflates it with gender identity.
