[Term]
id: GSSO:003293
name: civil right
def: "A class of rights that protect individuals' freedom from infringement by governments, social organizations, and private individuals. They ensure one's entitlement to participate in the civil and political life of the society and state without discrimination or repression." []
synonym: "civil and political rights" BROAD []
synonym: "civil rights and liberties" BROAD [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Civil_rights_and_liberties]
