[Term]
id: GSSO:003398
name: gender transition
name: tranzicioni gjinor
name: مراحل التغيير
def: "The process of changing one's gender presentation and/or sex characteristics to accord with one's internal sense of gender identity." []
comment: Transitioning is an umbrella term for changes undertaken to match their gender expression with their identified gender. Typically, there are two forms of gender transition: social transition (wearing different clothing, speaking with a difference cadence, using a diferent name, etc.) and physical transition (usage of hormones, various gender-affirming surgeries, etc.). Usually this distinction is unnecessary and used as a form of gatekeeping.
synonym: "gender transitioning" RELATED [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Gender_transitioning, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transitioning_(transgender)] {Property:P1813="transitioning"}
