def: "A transgender person who would like to become engaged in the process of surgical gender transition or any of its associated processes." []
comment: A transgender person's operation status is private. It is inappropriate to discuss their status unprompted. Only use "pre-op" or "pre-operative" if there is first discussion about the topic and the person indicates that they do plan on obtaining surgery at some point; otherwise, use non-operative.
