[Term]
id: GSSO:003803
name: political woman
def: "A political role filled by persons assigned female at birth and those who identify as women. For instance, a person assigned female at birth may be nonbinary or even live as a passing transgender man, but still has interests in what the state might consider \"women's health care\" (such as access to menstrual products, abortion services, and pregnancy-related care)." []
