[Term]
id: GSSO:003831
name: rape culture
def: "A sociological concept for a setting in which rape is pervasive and normalized due to societal attitudes about gender and sexuality. Behaviors commonly associated with rape culture include victim blaming, slut-shaming, sexual objectification, trivializing rape, denial of widespread rape, refusing to acknowledge the harm caused by sexual violence, or some combination of these." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rape_culture
