[Term]
id: GSSO:003834
name: respectability politics
def: "Attempts by marginalized groups to police their own members and show their social values as being continuous and compatible with dominant values rather than challenging the mainstream for what they see as its failure to accept difference." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Respectability_politics
