[Term]
id: GSSO:003970
name: ecomasculism
def: "A complimentary field of thought to ecofeminism. While ecofeminism has traditionally focused on studying issues such as how the exploitation of women and women's bodies is congruent with the exploitation of nature, ecomasculinity studies men's role in this process and looks for ways to enable men to take on roles that would challenge exploitative thought patterns and practices." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ecomasculinity
