[Term]
id: GSSO:004193
name: brain sex
def: "Theoretical classification of sex based on differences in brain structure observations." []
comment: The idea of "brain sex" is closely related to the concept of neurosexism, the assumption that gender differences in behavior are caused by observed differences in brain structure. It has been suggested that such assumptions essentially create a self-fulfilling prophecy since male and female children are raised differently because of these assumptions.
synonym: "neuroanatomical sex" RELATED []
synonym: "neurological sex" RELATED []
