[Term]
id: GSSO:004271
name: partner service
def: "A commercial experience that blurs the boundaries between a financial transaction and a romantic relationship. It ranges from a transactional sex relationship to a client paying a sex worker to pretend to be their partner during the session." []
comment: Because persons involved in this service may or may not exchange sex services, this term is classified outside of sex work. However, if sex work-related services are involved then the experience becomes sex work.
