[Term]
id: GSSO:004299
name: dance
def: "A performing art form consisting of purposefully selected sequences of human movement. This movement has aesthetic and symbolic value, and is acknowledged as dance by performers and observers within a particular culture. Dance can be categorized and described by its choreography, by its repertoire of movements, or by its historical period or place of origin." []
synonym: "dancing" RELATED []
