[Term]
id: GSSO:004300
name: music
def: "An art form and cultural activity whose medium is sound organized in time. General definitions of music include common elements such as pitch (which governs melody and harmony), rhythm (and its associated concepts tempo, meter, and articulation), dynamics (loudness and softness), and the sonic qualities of timbre and texture (which are sometimes termed the \"color\" of a musical sound). Different styles or types of music may emphasize, de-emphasize or omit some of these elements." []
synonym: "musical" RELATED []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Music
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q638
