[Term]
id: GSSO:004376
name: cultural history
def: "Cultural history combines the approaches of anthropology and history to look at popular cultural traditions and cultural interpretations of historical experience. It examines the records and narrative descriptions of past matter, encompassing the continuum of events (occurring in succession and leading from the past to the present and even into the future) pertaining to a culture." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Cultural_history
