property_value: terms:isReferencedBy https://books.google.com/books/?id=ymkYAAAAIAAJ

[Term]
id: GSSO:004424
name: Electra complex
def: "A girl's psychosexual competition with her mother for possession of her father. In the course of her psychosexual development, the complex is the girl's phallic stage; a boy's analogous experience is the Oedipus complex." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Electra_complex
is_a: GSSO:004422 ! psychodynamic complex
