[Term]
id: GSSO:004426
name: hero complex
def: "A phenomenon affecting people who seek heroism or recognition, usually by creating a situation which they can resolve. This can include unlawful acts, such as arson. The phenomenon has been noted to affect civil servants, such as firefighters, nurses, police officers, and security guards." []
synonym: "hero syndrome" RELATED []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hero_complex
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hero_syndrome
is_a: GSSO:004422 ! psychodynamic complex

[Term]
id: GSSO:004427
name: Cinderella complex
def: "A complex describing women's fear of independence – an unconscious desire to be taken care of by others. The complex is said to become more apparent as a person grows older." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cinderella_complex
is_a: GSSO:004422 ! psychodynamic complex
property_value: Property:P3938 http://isni.org/isni/0000000109185660

[Term]
id: GSSO:004428
name: god complex
def: "An unshakable belief characterized by consistently inflated feelings of personal ability, privilege, or infallibility. A person with a god complex may refuse to admit the possibility of their error or failure, even in the face of irrefutable evidence, intractable problems or difficult or impossible tasks." []
comment: God complex is not a clinical term nor diagnosable disorder and does not appear in the Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM).
synonym: "God complex" EXACT []
synonym: "Jehovah complex" RELATED []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/God_complex
is_a: GSSO:004422 ! psychodynamic complex
property_value: Property:P3938 http://isni.org/isni/0000000121266041 {dc:date="1913"}

[Term]
id: GSSO:004429
name: Jocasta complex
def: "The incestuous sexual desire of a mother towards her son." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jocasta_complex
is_a: GSSO:004422 ! psychodynamic complex
property_value: Property:P3938 http://isni.org/isni/0000000083822114 {dc:date="1920"}
property_value: terms:isReferencedBy https://books.google.com/books/?id=ymkYAAAAIAAJ

[Term]
id: GSSO:004430
name: Lolita complex
def: "Attraction to young or prepubescent girls or the Japanese discourse or media focusing on such attraction." []
synonym: "GSSO:001265" BROAD []
