[Term]
id: GSSO:004544
name: destructive narcissism
def: "The constant exhibition of numerous and intense characteristics usually associated with the pathological narcissist but having fewer characteristics than pathological narcissism." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Narcissism#Destructive_narcissism
is_a: GSSO:004540 ! narcissism
property_value: Property:P5191 GSSO:004540

[Term]
id: GSSO:004545
name: healthy narcissism
def: "The characteristic of possessing realistic self-esteem without being cut off from a shared emotional life, as the unhealthy narcissist tends to be." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Healthy_narcissism
is_a: GSSO:004540 ! narcissism
property_value: Property:P5191 GSSO:004540

[Term]
id: GSSO:004546
name: malignant narcissism
def: "A psychological syndrome comprising an extreme mix of narcissism, antisocial behavior, aggression, and sadism." []
def: "A syndrome consisting of a cross breed of the narcissistic personality disorder, the antisocial personality disorder, as well as paranoid traits." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malignant_narcissism
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Narcissism#Malignant_narcissism
is_a: GSSO:004540 ! narcissism
property_value: Property:P3938 http://isni.org/isni/0000000354889821 {dc:date="1964"}
property_value: Property:P5191 GSSO:004540

