[Term]
id: GSSO:004549
name: sexual narcissism
def: "An egocentric pattern of sexual behavior that involves an inflated sense of sexual ability and sexual entitlement. In addition, sexual narcissism is the erotic preoccupation with oneself as a superb lover through a desire to merge sexually with a mirror image of oneself." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Narcissism#Sexual_narcissism
is_a: GSSO:004540 ! narcissism
property_value: Property:P5191 GSSO:004540
property_value: seeAlso GSSO:007351

