name: utroskab {xref="https://lgbt.dk/ordbog/utroskab/"}
def: "A violation of a partner's assumed or stated contract regarding emotional and/or sexual exclusivity. Other scholars define infidelity as a violation according to the subjective feeling that one's partner has violated a set of rules or relationship norms; this violation results in feelings of jealousy, sexual jealousy, and rivalry." []
