[Term]
id: GSSO:005022
name: purse
def: "A small bag for the purpose of carrying currency, usually coins." []
comment: The term "purse" originally referred to a small bag for holding coins. In many English-speaking countries it is still used to refer to a small money bag. A "handbag" is a larger accessory that holds objects beyond currency, such as personal items. American English typically uses the terms purse and handbag interchangeably.
