[Term]
id: GSSO:005240
name: breasts Tanner stage I
def: "A Tanner stage characterized by a complete lack of glandular tissue; the areola follows the skin contours of the chest (typically age 10 and younger)." []
is_a: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma0328413 ! Tanner I
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "breasts Tanner I" xsd:string
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "breasts Tanner stage 1" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P927 http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma19898

[Term]
id: GSSO:005241
name: breasts Tanner stage II
def: "A Tanner stage characterized by the formation of the breast bud, with a small area of surrounding glandular tissue and a widening of the areola (typically age 10 to 11.5)." []
is_a: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma0328416 ! Tanner II
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "breasts Tanner stage 2" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P927 http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma19898

[Term]
id: GSSO:005242
name: breasts Tanner stage III
def: "A Tanner stage characterized by an elevation of the breast and extension beyond the borders of the areola, which continue to widen but remain in contour with surrounding breast (typically between age 11.5 and 13)." []
is_a: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma0328417 ! Tanner III
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "breasts Tanner III" xsd:string
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "breasts Tanner stage 3" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P927 http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma19898

[Term]
id: GSSO:005243
name: breasts Tanner stage IV
def: "A Tanner stage characterized by increased breast sizing and elevation during which the areola and papilla form a secondary mound projecting from the countour of the surrounding breast (typically ages 13 to 15)." []
is_a: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma0328418 ! Tanner IV
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "breasts Tanner IV" xsd:string
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "breasts Tanner stage 4" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P927 http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma19898

[Term]
id: GSSO:005244
name: breasts Tanner stage V
def: "A Tanner stage characterized by the breast reaching its final adult size during which the areola returns to contour of the surrounding breast with a projecting central papilla (typically age 15+)." []
is_a: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma0328419 ! Tanner V
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "breasts Tanner stage 5" xsd:string
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "breasts Tanner V" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P927 http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma19898

[Term]
id: GSSO:005245
name: testicles Tanner stage I
def: "A Tanner stage characterized by testicular volume less than 1.5 ml accompanied by a relatively small penis (typically age 9 and younger)." []
is_a: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma0328413 ! Tanner I
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "testicles Tanner I" xsd:string
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "testicles Tanner stage 1" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P927 UBERON:0000473

[Term]
id: GSSO:005246
name: testicles Tanner stage II
def: "A Tanner stage characterized by a testicular volume between 1.6 and 6 ml accompanied by the scrotal skin reddening and enlarging; the penis length remains unchanged (typically ages 9 to 11)." []
is_a: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma0328416 ! Tanner II
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "breasts Tanner II" xsd:string
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "testicles Tanner II" xsd:string
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "testicles Tanner stage 2" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P927 UBERON:0000473

[Term]
id: GSSO:005247
name: testicles Tanner stage III
def: "A Tanner stage characterized by a testicular volume between 6 and 12 ml during which the scrotum enlarges further and the penis begins to length (between ages 11 and 12.5)." []
is_a: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma0328417 ! Tanner III
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "testicles Tanner III" xsd:string
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "testicles Tanner stage 3" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P927 UBERON:0000473

[Term]
id: GSSO:005248
name: testicles Tanner stage IV
def: "A Tanner stage characterized by a testicular volume between 12 and 20 ml during which the scrotum enlarges further and darkens and the penis increases in length (between ages 12.5 and 14)." []
is_a: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma0328418 ! Tanner IV
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "testicles Tanner IV" xsd:string
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "testicles Tanner stage 4" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P927 UBERON:0000473

[Term]
id: GSSO:005249
name: testicles Tanner stage V
def: "A Tanner stage characterized by a testicular volume greater than 20 ml during which the scrotum and penis reach their adult sizes (typically age 14+)." []
is_a: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma0328419 ! Tanner V
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "testicles Tanner stage 5" xsd:string
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "testicles Tanner V" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P927 UBERON:0000473

