[Term]
id: GSSO:005522
name: anal lubricant
def: "Lubricants that are safe for anal sex, especially products that are specifically marketed or designed to enhance enjoyment of anal sex. Often, they are simply a thicker gel rather than a liquid. This thicker consistency is preferable because it helps the lubricant stay in place. Some anal lubricants contain numbing agents to relieve discomfort during anal sex, although it is generally inadvisable as a lack of sensation makes accidental injury more likely." []
synonym: "anal-specific lubricant" NARROW [] {schema:alternateName="anal-specific lubricants"}
is_a: GSSO:005520 ! personal lubricant
