property_value: schema:alternateName "Blackfeet" xsd:string

[Term]
id: GSSO:005916
name: Piegan
def: "An Algonquian-speaking people from the North American Great Plains. They were the largest of three Blackfoot-speaking groups that made up the Blackfoot Confederacy; the Siksika and Kainai were the others. The Piegan dominated much of the northern Great Plains during the nineteenth century." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piegan_Blackfeet
