[Term]
id: GSSO:005930
name: Southern Ute
def: "Any of the Southern Ute Tribes, including the Muache, Capote, and the Weeminuche, the latter of which are at Ute Mountain." []
is_a: GSSO:005929 ! Ute

[Term]
id: GSSO:005931
name: Tlingit
def: "Indigenous peoples of the Pacific Northwest Coast of North America. Their language is the Tlingit language, in which their name means \"People of the Tides\"." []
