[Term]
id: GSSO:005932
name: Kumeyaay
name: Kumiai
def: "Native American people of the extreme southwestern United States and northwest Mexico. They live in the states of California in the US and Baja California in Mexico. In Spanish, the name is commonly spelled Kumiai." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Kumeyaay
