[Term]
id: GSSO:005933
name: Tipai
def: "One of the main groups of the Kumeyaay, extending the southern shores of the San Diego River including the Laguna Mouthains, Ensenada, and Tecate." []
is_a: GSSO:005932 ! Kumeyaay

[Term]
id: GSSO:005934
name: Ipai
def: "One of the main groups of the Kumeyaay, extending the northern shores of the San Diego River from Escondido to Lake Henshaw." []
is_a: GSSO:005932 ! Kumeyaay

[Term]
id: GSSO:005935
name: Tanoan
def: "Any of various Indigenous Puebloan peoples who speak languages belonging to the Tanoan language family." []
is_a: GSSO:005494 ! Puebloan
