[Term]
id: GSSO:005948
name: Meskwaki
def: "A Native American people often known by Europeans and non-Indigenous Americans as the Fox tribe. They have been closely linked to the Sauk people of the same language family. In the Meskwaki language, the Meskwaki call themselves Meshkwahkihaki, which means \"the Red-Earths\", related to their creation story." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meskwaki
