[Term]
id: GSSO:005957
name: Otoe
def: "A Native American people of the Midwestern United States. The Otoe language, Chiwere, is part of the Siouan family and closely related to that of the related Iowa and Missouri tribes." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Otoe
