[Term]
id: GSSO:005979
name: Ktunaxa
def: "An Indigenous people of Canada and the United States. Kutenai bands live in southeastern British Columbia, northern Idaho, and western Montana. The Kutenai language is a language isolate, unrelated to the languages of neighboring peoples." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Ktunaxa
