[Term]
id: GSSO:005980
name: Klamath
def: "A Native American tribe of the Plateau culture area in Southern Oregon and Northern California. Today Klamath people are enrolled in the federally recognized tribes: Klamath Tribes and the Quartz Valley Indian Community." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Klamath
