property_value: Property:P1813 "RAD" xsd:string

[Term]
id: GSSO:006175
name: revenge pornography
def: "The distribution of sexually explicit images or video of individuals without their permission. The sexually explicit images or video may be made by a partner of an intimate relationship with the knowledge and consent of the subject, or it may be made without their knowledge. The possession of the material may be used by the perpetrators to blackmail the subjects into performing other sex acts, to coerce them into continuing the relationship, to punish them for ending the relationship, or to silence them." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Revenge_porn
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q15056789
