[Term]
id: GSSO:006771
name: epispadias
def: "A birth defect due to malformation of the urethra in which the urethral opening is above its normal location. In those with a penis, the malformed urethra generally opens on the top or the side of the penis, but the urethra can also be open the entire length of the penis. In those with a clitoris, the malformed urethral opening is often between the clitoris and the labia, or in the abdomen." []
