[Term]
id: GSSO:006897
name: acute traumatic stress disorder
def: "A class of traumatic stress disorders that is characterized by the significant dissociative states seen immediately after overwhelming trauma. By definition it cannot last longer than 1 month, if it persists, a diagnosis of post-traumatic stress disorder is more appropriate." []
