[Term]
id: GSSO:006966
name: Frasier syndrome
def: "A syndrome characterized by chronic kidney failure and gonadal dysgenesis in phenotypic females with karyotype of 46,XY or female individual with a normal 46,XX karyotype. It is caused by donor splice-site mutations of Wilms tumor suppressor gene on chromosome 11." []
