[Term]
id: GSSO:006971
name: 47,XXX syndrome
def: "A condition characterized by the presence of an extra X chromosome in each cell of a person who is XX. Those affected are usually taller than average, but otherwise unaffected physically, other than in terms of fertility. Occasionally there are learning difficulties, decreased muscle tone, seizures, or kidney problems." []
