[Term]
id: GSSO:006999
name: Potocki-Lupski syndrome
def: "A rare genetic disorder characterized by hypotonia, failure to thrive, intellectual disability, developmental disorders, congenital anomalies, and autism spectrum disorders. The majority of patients harbor a microduplication of chromosome 17p11." []
