[Term]
id: GSSO:007216
name: chosen name
def: "A name chosen by a person for themself." []
comment: Note that it is demeaning and highly inappropriate to put a transgender person's chosen name in quotation marks. It is also extremely offensive to imply that such a name is not a person's real name.
comment: Often (but not always) used in reference to transgender persons before their name is legally changed. In this context, a chosen name is a person's name, not a preferred name. It is also that person's real name.
is_a: SIO:000183 ! personal name
