[Term]
id: GSSO:007242
name: Apache Attack Helicopter gambit
def: "An appeal to extremes which compares gender and sexual minorities to someone who self-identifies as an attack helicopter. It falsely focuses upon self-identification rather than psychological and biological aspects of identity, insinuates that LGBTQIA+ persons are delusional in their identities, and compares requests for basic human rights to the ability to commit homicide." []
synonym: "I Sexually Identify as an Attack Helicopter" RELATED []
is_a: GSSO:007241 ! appeal to extremes
property_value: oboInOwl:hasSynonym "Attack Helicopter gambit" xsd:string
property_value: Property:P1683 "I sexually Identify as an Attack Helicopter. Ever since I was a boy I dreamed of soaring over the oilfields dropping hot sticky loads on disgusting foreigners. People say to me that a person being a helicopter is Impossible and I'm fucking retarded but I don't care, I'm beautiful. I'm having a plastic surgeon install rotary blades, 30 mm cannons and AMG-114 Hellfire missiles on my body. From now on I want you guys to call me \"Apache\" and respect my right to kill from above and kill needlessly. If you can't accept me you're a heliphobe and need to check your vehicle privilege. Thank you for being so understanding." xsd:string {schema:datePosted="2014-03-17T00:00:00", Property:P170="Guuse"}

