[Term]
id: GSSO:007605
name: hormonal microdosage
def: "A lower dosage of hormone replacement therapy sometimes utilized by transgender persons for various reasons. A transgender man or transgender woman may microdose in order to avoid being outed in an unsafe circumstance. Alternatively, nonbinary persons, genderqueer persons, or agender persons may microdose for more subtle physical and emotional effects that hormones provide." []
