[Term]
id: GSSO:007862
name: tida wena
def: "In Warao culture, a person who may contemporarily be considered assigned male at birth who occupies a mostly female gender role, is said to possess two spirits, and may assume a sociocultural role as a shaman. The term \"tida wena\" literally translates as \"twisted women\"." []
synonym: "Tida Wena" EXACT []
