[Term]
id: GSSO:008108
name: Corded Ware third gender
def: "A third gender category suggested by remains found in a Corded Ware burial ground found in a suburb of Prague, Czech Republic in April of 2011. The remains were believed to have been of a person who would've been assigned male at birth, but the grave did not carry any gender-specific grave goods and the orientation of the body was in a stereotypically feminine position for the culture." []
is_a: GSSO:002024 ! gendered person
is_a: GSSO:011211 ! European culturally-specific gender identity
