[Term]
id: GSSO:008147
name: flail
def: "A weapon consisting of a striking head attached to a handle by a flexible rope, strap, or chain. The chief tactical virtue of the flail was its capacity to strike around a defender's shield or parry. Its chief liability was a lack of precision and the difficulty of using it in close combat, or closely ranked formations." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Flail_weapons
