[Term]
id: GSSO:009007
name: AIDS survivor syndrome
def: "A syndrome defined by the psychological effects of living with the long-term trajectory of the AIDS epidemic and includes survivor's guilt, depression, and feelings of being forgotten in contemporary discussions concerning HIV." []
is_a: GSSO:009006 ! survivor syndrome

