is_a: GSSO:009011 ! determinism

[Term]
id: GSSO:009013
name: social determinism
def: "The theory that social interactions and constructs alone determine individual behavior (as opposed to biological or objective factors)." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_determinism
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3045364
is_a: GSSO:009011 ! determinism

[Term]
