[Term]
id: GSSO:009468
name: gender modality
def: "The correspondence (or lack thereof) between one's assigned gender at birth and one's actual gender and/or gender presentation. The two primary, and most well known gender modalities are cisgender and transgender. However those are not the only possible relations for one to have. Gender modality is an open-ended category which welcomes the elaboration of further terms." []
xref: https://mogai-genders.fandom.com/wiki/Gender_Modality
xref: https://nonbinary.wiki/wiki/Gender_modality
