[Term]
id: GSSO:009522
name: semi-authentic birth certificate
def: "A type of Quebec birth certificated issued with regard to a birth that occurred outside of Quebec, under paragraph 137 of the Civil Code of Québec, until their full authenticity is recognized by a Quebec court." []
is_a: GSSO:000456 ! birth certificate
property_value: schema:alternateName "semi-authentic birth certificates" xsd:string

[Term]
id: GSSO:009523
name: DND 419 birth certificate
def: "A type of birth certificate issued from 1963 until November 1979 by the Department of National Defense in Canada to dependents of Canadian Forces members born overseas. These certificates were never accorded legal status, but served as a convenient substitute for the original record of birth from the country of birth. Today, the DND 419 is recognised as a proof of age, but not of citizenship." []
is_a: GSSO:000456 ! birth certificate
property_value: schema:alternateName "DND 419 birth certificates" xsd:string

