[Term]
id: GSSO:009738
name: gender-neutral parenting
def: "A parenting style in which gender roles are not directly imposed upon a child. This may involve presenting activities as non-gendered, buying of gender-neutral or unisex clothing until the child chooses their own, and/or usage of gender-neutral pronouns and forms of address until specified by the child." []
