[Term]
id: GSSO:010054
name: Westboro Baptist Church
def: "An American extremist cult and hate group known for engaging in pickets with inflammatory homophobic, transphobic, anti-American, anti-atheist, anti-Christian, antisemitic, anti-Mormon, and Islamophobic hate speech. It is not affiliated with any Baptist denomination and has been denounced by Baptist conventions, including the Baptist World Alliance and the Southern Baptist Convention, and by other mainstream Christian denominations. The Westboro Baptist Church (WBC) has been involved in actions against LGBTQ+ people since at least 1991, when it sought a crackdown on homosexual activity at Gage Park near its headquarters. In addition to conducting anti-gay protests at military funerals, the organization pickets celebrity funerals and public events. Protests have also been held against Jews, against Mormons, and against Catholics. Many protests have included WBC members defacing the American flag, flying the flag upside down on a flagpole, and holding protest signs with inflammatory statements; the most notable of which being \"God hates fags\" and \"Thank God for dead soldiers\"." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category\:Westboro_Baptist_Church
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westboro_Baptist_Church
