[Term]
id: GSSO:010068
name: anger rapist
def: "A rapist who uses rape to humiliate, debase, and hurt their victim; they express their contempt for their victim through physical violence and profane language. For these rapists, sex is a weapon to defile and degrade the victim, rape constitutes the ultimate expression of their anger. This rapist considers rape the ultimate offense they can commit against the victim." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Types_of_rapist#Anger_rapist
is_a: GSSO:010062 ! rapist
property_value: schema:alternateName "anger rapists" xsd:string

