[Term]
id: GSSO:010190
name: anti-urbanism
def: "Hostility toward the city as opposed to the country, a simple rejection of the city, or a wish to destroy the city; discrimination against persons seen as belonging to cities. Such hostility and/or discrimination may be individualized or collective. Anti-urbanism may also be interpreted as a philosophy which aims to tackle metronormative ways of life. The phenomenon of anti-urbanism is often linked to urban and/or metropolitan bias." []
synonym: "antiurbanism" EXACT []
is_a: GSSO:010189 ! environmental discrimination

[Term]
