[Term]
id: GSSO:010893
name: respectful wage
def: "A wage which respects an individual as a human being with needs and wants who deserves human dignity. Often contrasted with a \"living wage\" or a \"minimum wage\", both of which emphasize the bare minimum of consideration of a human being, rather than respecting the individual beyond a bare minimum standard of living." []
