[Term]
id: GSSO:010898
name: antisemitic canard
def: "Any of various sensational reports, misrepresentations, or fabrications that are defamatory towards Judaism as a religion or defamatory towards Jews as an ethnic or religious group. Since at least the Middle Ages, they have formed parts of broader antisemitic conspiracy theories." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antisemitic_canard
