[Term]
id: GSSO:011186
name: infodemiology
def: "An area of science research focused on scanning the internet for user-contributed health-related content, with the ultimate goal of improving public health. It is also defined as the science of mitigating public health problems resulting from an infodemic." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infodemiology
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17056302
is_a: GSSO:011185 ! applied epidemiology

[Term]
id: GSSO:011187
