is_a: GSSO:011187 ! outbreak
property_value: schema:alternateName "information outbreaks" xsd:string

[Term]
id: GSSO:011189
name: infodemic
def: "A portmanteau of \"information\" and \"epidemic\" that typically refers to a rapid and far-reaching spread of both accurate and inaccurate information about something, such as a disease. As facts, rumors, and fears mix and disperse, it becomes difficult to learn essential information about an issue." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infodemic
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q94438711
is_a: GSSO:011188 ! information outbreak
property_value: schema:alternateName "infodemics" xsd:string

[Term]
