synonym: "misgendering on purpose" RELATED []
is_a: GSSO:011477 ! misgendering

[Term]
id: GSSO:011481
name: unintentional misgendering
def: "To misgender someone without necessarily the explicit intent to do so, usually as the result of an accident." []
comment: When unintentionally misgendering occurs, it is usually polite to quickly correct oneself and continue on, rather than to dwell on the accident.
synonym: "accidental misgendering" RELATED []
synonym: "misgendering by accident" RELATED []
is_a: GSSO:011477 ! misgendering

