synonym: "andromonoecious" RELATED []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andromonoecy
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q108131520
is_a: GSSO:011865 ! monomorphic sexual system

[Term]
id: GSSO:011872
name: dioecy
def: "A sexual system in which a species has distinct individual organisms that are either male or female, i.e., they produce only male or only female gametes, either directly (in animals) or indirectly (in plants)." []
comment: Typically "dioecy" is used to refer to plants, and "gonochorism" is used to refer to animals.
synonym: "dioecious" RELATED []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dioecy
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q148681
