[Term]
id: GSSO:012910
name: queer archaeology
def: "An approach to archaeology that uses queer theory to challenge normative, and especially heteronormative, views of the past." []
xref: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queer_archaeology
xref: https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q108584195
