[Term]
id: http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/MESH/D008594
name: premature menopause
def: "The premature cessation of menses when the last menstrual period occurs in a woman under the age of 40. It is due to the depletion of ovarian follicles.\n Premature menopause can be caused by diseases; ovariectomy; radiation; chemicals; and chromosomal abnormalities." []
