[Term]
id: http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/MESH/D013741
name: 5α-reductase
def: "An enzyme that catalyzes the reduction of testosterone to 5α-dihydrotestosterone." []
def: "An oxidoreductase that catalyzes the conversion of 3-oxo-Δ4 steroids into their corresponding 5α form. It plays an important role in the conversion of testosterone into dihydrotestosterone and progesterone into dihydroprogesterone." []
