[Term]
id: http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/MESH/D047648
name: perimenopause
def: "The transitional period before and after menopause. Perimenopausal symptoms are associated with irregular menstrual cycle and widely fluctuated hormone levels. They may appear 6 years before menopause and subside 2 to 5 years after menopause." []
synonym: "peri-menopause" EXACT []
is_a: GO:0042697 ! menopause
