[Term]
id: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma18252
name: scrotum
def: "A cutaneous pouch of skin containing the testicles and spermatic cords." []
def: "The external sac of skin that encloses the testes. It is an extension of the abdomen, and in placentals is located between the penis and anus." []
def: "The musculocutaneous pouch that encloses the testicles." []
def: "The pouch that contains the testes and their accessory organs. It is composed of skin, the tunica dartos, the spermatic, cremasteric, and infundibuliform fasciae, and the tunica vaginalis testis." []
