[Term]
id: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma46472
name: nose
def: "A part of the upper respiratory tract. It contains the organ of smell. The term includes the external nose, the nasal cavity, and the paranasal sinuses." []
def: "A structure of special sense serving as an organ of the sense of smell and as an entrance to the respiratory tract." []
def: "Subdivision of face which consists of skeletal system of nose, all layers superficial to it (integument, mucosa, muscle, connective tissue) and nasal cavity." []
def: "The olfactory organ of vertebrates, consisting of nares, olfactory epithelia and the structures and skeletal framework of the nasal cavity." []
synonym: "nasal" RELATED []
