[Term]
id: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma9579
name: perineum
def: "Subdivision of trunk proper, which is demarcated from the pelvis by the inferior surface of the pelvic diaphragm and from the lower limbs by the perineofemoral lines; together with the thorax, and abdomen, it constitutes the trunk proper." []
