[Term]
id: http://purl.org/sig/ont/fma/fma9909
name: clitoris
def: "An erectile structure homologous with the penis, situated beneath the anterior labial commissure, partially hidden between the anterior ends of the labia minora." []
def: "The erectile tissue in the vulva. It is composed of the corpora cavernosa and the glans clitoris." []
comment: Sometimes transgender people refer to their penis as a clitoris in order to reduce dysphoria associated with it.
